          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On Saturday, March 14, 2009, between 10:00 PM and 10:05 PM, an individual on their terrace was intrigued by the regular S-N movement of a group of lights forming a \"V\" shape. The observation was very brief, and the witness did not notice any particular noise. The most plausible hypothesis (a low-flying plane or a formation of military aircraft) does not fit (appearance, silence); the GEIPAN was unable to request verification from air traffic control in time. A field investigation conducted several years later would yield very little reliable information. Without these verifications, this case is classified as C due to a lack of information.",
